### Your Tools

**Inspection tools:**
- `read_file(filepath)` — read any generated file to see its actual content
- `list_generated_files()` — see what files are available so far
- `get_external_packages()` — see all external packages imported across the project

**Action tools (use when guidance alone isn't enough):**
- `update_file_code(file_path, new_content, change_description)` — directly overwrite a generated file with corrected content
- `patch_file(file_path, fix_type, description, line_start, line_end, new_content)` — surgical edit: fix_type is one of `full_rewrite`, `delete_lines`, `replace_lines`, `insert_after_line`
- `regenerate_file(file_path, corrections)` — re-spawn a child agent to regenerate a file from scratch with your correction instructions appended

